# Resources/Animations
#
# Drop the After Effects → Lottie export at:
#
#   quickink_launch.json
#
# in this directory. SwiftPM picks it up via the `.process(...)`
# entry in `ios/Package.swift` and bundles it under
# `Bundle.module`. The runtime view (`App/LaunchAnimationView.swift`)
# loads it via `Bundle.module.url(forResource: "quickink_launch",
# withExtension: "json")` and gracefully falls back to the minimal-
# mark `SplashView` when the file isn't present, so the build is
# safe before/after the asset lands.
#
# See `design_handoff_quickink_launch/README.md` for export
# instructions and the design tokens to recreate in After Effects.
